Z||000007||rodmcneill||11-27-2000||11:54 PM||||If you don't need to own a manual, maybe you should check with your local bigger library. My local library has all the Helms manuals from 84-88 for the Fiero. You could even copy certain pages,we won't tell!||||reg||1
